<Slide style={{ background: '#FFFFFF', padding: '60px', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Text style={{ fontSize: 34, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A' }}>现场怎么演示：一个 HTML，三步</Text>
    <Box style={{ width: 1160, height: 1, background: '#D9DEE6', marginTop: 12 }} />

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'center', marginTop: 18 }}>
        <Image src="assets/hero.png" style={{ width: 720, height: 371, objectFit: 'cover', borderRadius: 6, border: '1px solid #E5E9F0' }} />
    </Box>

    <Box style={{ flexDirection: 'row', gap: 40, marginTop: 16 }}>
        {[
            ['01', '打开 docs/demo.html', '首屏 4 个数字，两个入口'],
            ['02', '点「看交易画像」', '16 型、四维坐标、改法'],
            ['03', '点「看逐笔复盘」', '11 手的 0–100 合理性'],
        ].map(function (it, i) {
            return (
                <Box key={i} style={{ width: 360, flexDirection: 'column' }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#B08D57' }}>{it[0]}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', marginTop: 2 }}>{it[1]}</Text>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#64748B', marginTop: 2 }}>{it[2]}</Text>
                </Box>
            );
        })}
    </Box>

    <Text style={{ fontSize: 18, color: '#1A1A1A', marginTop: 18 }}>
        单文件、无后端，双击就能开；<span style={{ fontWeight: 'bold' }}>断网也能演示</span>。
    </Text>
</Slide>
